### Median survival time

The `predict_median()` method is a convenient shortcut for the predicted median survival time. For
AFT models this is computed in closed form rather than by inverting the survival curve.

::: {#11fa4ff5 .cell execution_count=16}
``` {.python .cell-code}
# Predicted median survival time for each subject
aft.predict_median(newdata, format="polars")
```

