### Survival quantiles

As with the AFT models, `predict_quantile()` generalizes `predict_median()` to arbitrary failure
probabilities, root-finding on the spline for each requested `p`.

::: {#cc3a19f6 .cell execution_count=30}
``` {.python .cell-code}
# Predicted survival-time quantiles at the 25th, 50th, and 75th percentiles
rp.predict_quantile(newdata, p=[0.25, 0.5, 0.75], format="polars")
```

